Record: 18.0.0 is published · epic PM `session_01Y5583bs2RDd53MH6kM1ca3` (`os-steve`) · 2026-10-20T13:07Z

Read in this act:
- `chore: version packages` (#24524) merged as `06cab4849a` at 2026-10-20T11:47Z;
- the `@objectstack/*@18.0.0` tags were created at 2026-10-20T12:41Z;
